<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/info-pages.css">

<main class="info-page faq-page">

    <section class="info-hero">

        <h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1>

        <p class="page-subtitle">
            Find answers to common questions about our handmade pieces,
            commissions, and ordering.
        </p>
    </section>


    <section class="faq-accordion">

        <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question">
                <span>HOW ARE YOUR HANDMADE PIECES CREATED?</span>
                <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
            </button>

            <div class="faq-answer">
                <p>
                    Our handmade pieces are carefully created by hand using 
                    clay and other materials needed to complete each design. 
                    We shape and mold the clay, add the small details, and 
                    carefully finish each piece to achieve its intended look. 
                    Since every piece is handmade, each creation has its own 
                    small differences and unique character.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>


        <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question">
                <span>WHAT IS YOUR CREATION PROCESS?</span>
                <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
            </button>

            <div class="faq-answer">
                <p>
                    Our creation process starts with developing the 
                    design and preparing the materials needed for 
                    the piece. The clay is then carefully shaped and 
                    formed according to the design, followed by adding 
                    details and other elements that make the piece unique. 
                    Once the piece is finished, it is carefully checked 
                    and given its final touches before it is prepared for 
                    the customer.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>


        <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question">
                <span>HOW LONG DOES IT TAKE TO MAKE A PIECE?</span>
                <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
            </button>

            <div class="faq-answer">
                <p>
                   The time needed to create a piece depends on its design, 
                   size, and level of detail. Simple pieces may take less time, 
                   while more detailed or personalized designs require more time
                    and attention to make sure every part is carefully finished. 
                    Custom orders may also take longer because they are created 
                    specifically according to the customer's request.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>


        <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question">
                <span>WHAT MATERIALS DO YOU USE?</span>
                <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
            </button>

            <div class="faq-answer">
                <p>
                    We mainly use clay to create our handmade 
                    pieces, together with other materials needed 
                    for adding details, attaching components, 
                    and giving each creation its finished look. 
                    The materials used may vary depending on 
                    the design and type of piece being made. We 
                    carefully choose the materials needed to create 
                    each piece while keeping its handmade quality and 
                    appearance.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>


        <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question">
                <span>CAN I REQUEST A CUSTOM PIECE?</span>
                <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
            </button>

            <div class="faq-answer">
                <p>
                    Yes! KV Artchives accepts commission requests 
                    for personalized handmade pieces. You can share 
                    your ideas, preferred design, or inspiration with 
                    us, and we can discuss the details of your requested
                    piece. Since custom pieces are made specifically for 
                    each customer, the design, details, and production time 
                    may vary depending on the request. For commission inquiries, 
                    please visit our Commissions section and contact us through 
                    our available channels.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>


        <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question">
                <span>HOW CAN I PLACE AN ORDER?</span>
                <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
            </button>

            <div class="faq-answer">
                <p>
                    You can browse the available handmade pieces through 
                    our Shop and select a product to view its details before 
                    placing an order. Once you decide on a piece, you can 
                    proceed with the ordering and checkout process provided 
                    on the website. For custom or personalized pieces, orders 
                    are handled through our commission process, where you can 
                    contact us directly to discuss your request and the details 
                    of your desired piece.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question">
                <span>WHERE CAN I CONTACT KV ARTCHIVES?</span>
                <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
            </button>

            <div class="faq-answer">
                <p>
                    For questions, commission requests, order concerns, or other 
                    inquiries, you can contact KV Artchives through the contact 
                    channels provided on our website. You may also reach out to 
                    us regarding a specific handmade piece, custom request, or any 
                    information you would like to clarify before placing an order.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

    </section>

</main>


<script>
    document.querySelectorAll(".faq-question").forEach(button => {
        button.addEventListener("click", () => {

            const currentItem = button.parentElement;

            document.querySelectorAll(".faq-item").forEach(item => {
                if (item !== currentItem) {
                    item.classList.remove("active");
                }
            });

            currentItem.classList.toggle("active");
        });
    });
</script>